        <mxCell id="guard" value="NON-NEGOTIABLE GUARDRAILS&#xa;&#xa;• Corrected Jianpu, Chinese lyrics and Soprano are never overwritten by photo inference.&#xa;• Missing Alto/Tenor/Bass photo evidence is not silently filled by harmony inference.&#xa;• Inference challenges a reading; it does not become photo evidence.&#xa;• Unresolved conflicts remain visible and blocked from final emission.&#xa;• Beam direction, stem direction, overlap and connection-line geometry follow supported photo evidence." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF7ED;strokeColor=#EA580C;fontColor=#374151;fontSize=13;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=14;spacingLeft=14;" parent="1" vertex="1">
